Prayer Flicker

Plugin
Original quick-prayer behavior by Ethan Vann, maintained by Piggy Plugins
(https://github.com/vjohnny/PiggyPlugins). That work is licensed under the GNU
Affero General Public License v3.0. This project stays under AGPL-3.0 because it
derives from that code. See LICENSE.

The config group key remains KrakenPrayerFlicker so saved hotkeys survive.
The in-client name is [VJ]Prayer Flicker. The minimap-orb toggle from the
original plugin is not included. Turning the flicker off is queued onto the
RuneLite client thread and does not block the Swing thread.

